<title>CANADA: Rogers says Amtelecom cancels sale.</title>
<headline>Rogers says Amtelecom cancels sale.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rogers Communications Inc said on Monday it was informed by Amtelecom Group Inc that Amtelecom will not complete the previously announced purchase of the St. Thomas and Tillsonburg cable systems from unit Rogers Cablesystems Ltd.</p>
<p>Rogers said Amtelecom's decision was due to its decision not to proceed with its previously announced common share financing.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
